/// \defgroup grp_common_services Common services
/// \brief File system, BIG archives, chunk files, strings, name keys, the
///        function lexicon, debug and profile.
///
/// The engine-wide services every other subsystem uses: `FileSystem`
/// (`TheFileSystem`) and its loose-file and archive back ends, the `File`
/// classes, the `DataChunkInput` and `DataChunkOutput` chunk-file reader
/// and writer, the `StringBase` template behind `AsciiString` and
/// `UnicodeString`, `NameKeyGenerator` (`TheNameKeyGenerator`),
/// `FunctionLexicon`, and EA's debug and profile libraries.
/// \ref sub_common_services describes the subsystem, the file search order,
/// its state and its differences from Zero Hour.
